# Session-anchor cells (methodology/continuous-benchmarking-proposal.md §2).
# Every automated session runs its platform's anchors FIRST; cross-session
# comparisons are scored through them (regression_diff.py --anchors).
# Two anchors per platform where two arms exist, so the diff tool can pick an
# anchor whose runtime differs from the engine under test (an anchor measured
# by the engine being bumped is confounded).
# 2026-10-19: the Android LiteRT-LM anchor moved from qwen3_0_6b_mixed_int4.litertlm (its template drops the user
# turn on LiteRT-LM v0.18.0, google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM#3688) to Qwen3-0.6B_dynamic_wi4b32_afp32.litertlm (dynamic
# INT4, block-32 weights, FP32 act), with the weekly Android rows. A page cell and its series select rows by arm,
# model id and task, not by file, so an old-file anchor would put its number into the GPU short-chat page cell
# whenever an anchors phase is newer than that cell's payload. It does not gate admission (scripts/dashboard_job.py
# anchor_cells: the primary anchor is the non-litert arm); a regression pair across this date normalized through it
# (a llama.cpp bump on Android) compares two files. The Mac and iPhone LiteRT-LM anchors keep
# litert-community/Qwen3-0.6B: their page rows moved to the catalog id
# litert-community/Qwen3-0.6B/dynamic_wi4b32_afp32. The iOS LiteRT-LM anchor runs the dynamic INT8 bundle (dynamic_int8) from
# 2026-10-19 12:2x: the INT4 build fails at engine creation on the iPhone's Metal GPU (docs/dashboard-cells-v1.md).

ios mlx-swift mlx-community/Qwen3-0.6B-4bit short-chat anchor=1 runs=3
ios litert-lm litert-community/Qwen3-0.6B/dynamic_int8 short-chat anchor=1 runs=3

mac mlx-swift mlx-community/Qwen3-0.6B-4bit short-chat anchor=1 runs=3
mac litert-lm litert-community/Qwen3-0.6B/dynamic_wi4b32_afp32 short-chat anchor=1 runs=3

android litert-lm litert-community/Qwen3-0.6B short-chat anchor=1 runs=3 backend=gpu file=Qwen3-0.6B_dynamic_wi4b32_afp32.litertlm
android llama.cpp unsloth/Qwen3-0.6B-GGUF short-chat anchor=1 runs=3 file=Qwen3-0.6B-Q4_K_M.gguf
